@pavlovcik It’s a pity that Stripe rejected us even with an application from a US company!
@rndquu I appreciate you putting together a list of providers. 
Some time ago I contacted the majority of the providers from the list. Overall, I received dozens of rejections, and even more providers just did not respond to me.
If, after reading my [report](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m3fcKkPg7aIhkLD0vfJxTZFwGBUdq1vv6UhL2Jt9gcc/edit?usp=drive_link) and Stripe's rejection, you think it makes sense to contact other providers, then I can do that.
Using a BVI company significantly reduces the likelihood of cooperation with most providers.
Please clarify whether I can use a US company, or continue to use a BVI company.

